source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Regenerates host projects and registrants and compiles their Rust inputs

Usage: leptoskit native prepare [OPTIONS] <TARGET>

Arguments:
  <TARGET>
          Possible values:
          - macos:            A native AppKit application for this Mac's architecture
          - ios-simulator
          - ios
          - android
          - android-x86_64:   Android x86-64 devices and hosted CI emulators
          - harmonyos:        HarmonyOS arm64 devices and arm64 emulators (DevEco Studio)
          - harmonyos-x86_64: HarmonyOS x86-64 emulators

Options:
      --release
          

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
